<view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="title">我的小书</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="orders">我的订单 ›</button></view><view class="sub">宝宝的小小日常，都在这里。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理书架…</view><view wx:elif="{{!books.length}}" class="empty"><image src="/assets/bird.webp" mode="aspectFit"/><view>第一本小书，等你来写。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="create">记下今天的小故事</button></view><view wx:else class="grid section"><view wx:for="{{books}}" wx:key="id"><view class="cover" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="open"><image wx:if="{{item.cover}}" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image wx:else src="/assets/bird.webp" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="pill">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="cover-title" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="open">{{item.title}}</view><view class="row"><text class="tiny">{{item.date}}</text><button class="text-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="menu" aria-label="{{item.title}}，更多操作">···</button></view></view></view><button class="footer-entry" bindtap="products">叽咕其他产品 · 一起读英语绘本 ›</button><view class="tiny center">照片和小书默认私密 · 删除小书会一并删除关联照片</view></view>